  "helpRoutineRow4When": "End of month",
  "helpRoutineRow4What": "Check the balance and save a backup",
  "helpRoutineRow4Where": "Report · Settings › Backup",
  "helpRoutineGoldenTitle": "The golden rule:",
  "helpRoutineGolden": "if you don't record it, the app doesn't know it. It doesn't invent numbers: it says what's missing.",
  "helpRoutineTwiceTitle": "Three things you don't record twice",
  "helpRoutineTwice1": "The harvest: it's recorded with the sale (kilos) or with the harvest wage, not both.",
  "helpRoutineTwice2": "The worker's payment: it goes in Labor, not in the task category.",
  "helpRoutineTwice3": "The planting cost: it goes in the planting and creates its linked expense; it isn't repeated in Record.",
  "helpDictTitle": "What your numbers mean",
  "helpDictIntro": "The terms you'll see most. Tap “See all terms” for the full glossary.",
  "helpDictSeeAll": "See all terms",
  "helpDictCurrencyTitle": "Currency",
  "helpDictCurrencyBody": "The app always shows the currency code, never a symbol. It doesn't add different currencies: each one appears separately, with its code. The account currency is chosen at the start and can't be changed.",
  "helpTroubleTitle": "If something doesn't add up",
  "helpTrouble1Title": "The expense doesn't show up in the crop",
  "helpTrouble1Body": "Check that you assigned it. If it stayed “Not specified,” it falls under “Common costs.”",
  "helpTrouble2Title": "The sale doesn't match the harvest",
  "helpTrouble2Body": "The sale records the harvest with the kilos you enter. If you already recorded it in the wage, don't repeat it.",
  "helpTrouble3Title": "There are two currencies and I don't see a total",
  "helpTrouble3Body": "That's on purpose: different currencies aren't added. Each one appears with its code.",
  "helpTrouble4Title": "The area doesn't add up",
  "helpTrouble4Body": "The sum of crops can exceed the land area. The app warns you, it doesn't block you. Fix the area or the split.",
  "helpTrouble5Title": "It didn't upload to the cloud",
  "helpTrouble5Body": "The app saves to your device first. Without a signal it stays pending and uploads when you reconnect. You can retry.",
  "helpTrouble6Title": "I deleted something by mistake",
  "helpTrouble6Body": "Check History. If it isn't there, restore the backup: what you already had is kept and the file's data is added.",
  "helpTroubleFooter": "Can't find your case? Record what happened and the report adjusts. The app doesn't invent numbers: if a piece of data is missing, it says so.",

